WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:03.226
The arrow whizzed along.

2
00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:07.446
Cora and Mo swam close behind it.

3
00:00:07.447 --> 00:00:11.831
Finally the arrow stopped.

4
00:00:11.832 --> 00:00:16.635
"Star!" Cora shouted.

5
00:00:16.636 --> 00:00:21.902
Star was lying on the seafloor.

6
00:00:21.903 --> 00:00:25.420
"Did that seagull hurt you?" Mo asked.

7
00:00:25.421 --> 00:00:31.678
"I just have a sore arm," Star said.

8
00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:36.748
"Be careful!" Cora said. "Walt is—"

9
00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:40.260
"There you are!" Walt said.

10
00:00:40.261 --> 00:00:43.855
"You found the starfish!"

11
00:00:43.856 --> 00:00:46.870
"Careful, Cora!" Mo said.

12
00:00:46.871 --> 00:00:49.609
"He looks hungry."

13
00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.053
Cora wrapped her tentacles around Star.

14
00:00:53.054 --> 00:00:54.898
"Back off, Walt.

15
00:00:54.899 --> 00:00:58.078
Find something else to eat!"

16
00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:03.073
"Yeah!" Mo made himself big and spiky.

17
00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:07.652
"Leave her alone, Walt.

18
00:01:07.653 --> 00:01:11.484
Star is not your dinner!"

19
00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:14.616
"Ha-ha!" Walt laughed loudly.

20
00:01:14.617 --> 00:01:20.520
"I'm not going to eat her.

21
00:01:20.521 --> 00:01:26.097
I just wanted to scare that nasty seagull!"

22
00:01:26.098 --> 00:01:31.998
Mo frowned. "Then why did you follow us?"

23
00:01:31.999 --> 00:01:37.056
"I know why!" Cora moved closer to Walt.

24
00:01:37.057 --> 00:01:40.845
"You were worried about Star too!"

25
00:01:40.846 --> 00:01:50.005
Walt's face turned red. "Maybe . . . a little."

26
00:01:50.006 --> 00:01:56.567
Soon everyone swam back to the surface.

27
00:01:56.568 --> 00:02:01.376
More beautiful sky colors appeared. Boom!

28
00:02:01.377 --> 00:02:06.545
"Cora!" Mandy said. "What took you so long?"

29
00:02:06.546 --> 00:02:17.923
Cora laughed. "Um, something came up!"

